{"path": "/union-catholic-track-field-camp/", "title": "UC Track & Field Camp – Union Catholic Cross Country | Track + Field", "description": "Union Catholic Track & FieldTrain with the Vikings.A four-day summer camp built to introduce young athletes to the fundamentals of track & field in a positive, high-energy environment…", "ogImage": "/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/cropped-cropped-uctflogoheader.png", "ogType": "website", "bodyClass": "wp-singular page-template-default page page-id-10088 wp-custom-logo wp-embed-responsive wp-theme-uc-championship", "mainId": "primary", "mainClass": "site-main inner-page", "live": {}, "styles": ["main.css", "uc-pages.css", "uc-refresh.css"], "headInline": [], "scripts": [{"src": "/assets/main.js"}], "html": "\n<section class=\"inner-hero\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"inner-hero__overlay\"></div>\n<div class=\"site-shell inner-hero__content\">\n<h1>UC Track &amp; Field Camp</h1>\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inner-hero__rule\"></span>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section inner-content-section\">\n<div class=\"site-shell article-shell\">\n<article class=\"article article--page post-10088 page type-page status-publish hentry\">\n<div class=\"article__content entry-content\"><div class=\"uc-camp\"><section class=\"uc-camp-hero\"><div class=\"uc-camp-hero__copy\"><div class=\"uc-camp-kicker\">Union Catholic Track &amp; Field</div><h2>Train with the Vikings.</h2><p>A four-day summer camp built to introduce young athletes to the fundamentals of track &amp; field in a positive, high-energy environment led by the Union Catholic coaching staff.</p><div class=\"uc-camp-hero__meta\"><span>Grades 3–9</span><span>Boys + Girls</span><span>All Experience Levels</span></div></div><div class=\"uc-camp-hero__image\"><img alt=\"Union Catholic track and field athletes at the Virginia Beach Showcase\" class=\"uc-camp-hero-real\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2013/04/UC-Girls-VA-Showcase-2026.png\"/><img alt=\"Union Catholic track and field athletes at the Virginia Beach Showcase\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,[... ELLIPSIZATION ...] L...\"/></div></section><div class=\"uc-camp-soon\" role=\"status\"><span class=\"uc-camp-soon__badge\">Coming Soon</span><div><strong>2027 Camp Information</strong><p>Dates, times and registration for the summer 2027 camp will be posted here soon. Details from the 2026 camp are below for reference.</p></div></div><div class=\"uc-camp-sectionhead\"><h3>2026 Camp Information</h3><p>Last summer’s camp, for reference</p></div><section class=\"uc-camp-info\"><div class=\"uc-camp-info__card\"><span class=\"uc-camp-info__label\">Dates</span><span class=\"uc-camp-info__value\">July 13–16</span><span class=\"uc-camp-info__sub\">Monday through Thursday</span></div><div class=\"uc-camp-info__card\"><span class=\"uc-camp-info__label\">Time</span><span class=\"uc-camp-info__value\">9:00 AM–12:00 PM</span><span class=\"uc-camp-info__sub\">Three hours each morning</span></div><div class=\"uc-camp-info__card\"><span class=\"uc-camp-info__label\">Ages</span><span class=\"uc-camp-info__value\">Grades 3–9</span><span class=\"uc-camp-info__sub\">Athletes of all experience levels</span></div><div class=\"uc-camp-info__card\"><span class=\"uc-camp-info__label\">Cost</span><span class=\"uc-camp-info__value\">$250</span><span class=\"uc-camp-info__sub\">Four-day camp</span></div></section><div class=\"uc-camp-sectionhead\"><h3>Events We Teach</h3><p>Learn the fundamentals across track &amp; field</p></div><section class=\"uc-camp-events\"><h3>Run. Jump. Throw.</h3><p>Campers rotate through event areas and learn skills, drills, technique, and competition basics from the UC staff.</p><div class=\"uc-event-list\"><span>Sprints</span><span>Distance</span><span>Long Jump</span><span>Shot Put</span><span>Discus</span><span>Javelin</span></div></section><div class=\"uc-camp-sectionhead\"><h3>Camp Staff</h3><p>Led by Union Catholic coaches</p></div><section class=\"uc-camp-staff\"><div class=\"uc-camp-staff__lead\"><span class=\"uc-staff-role\">Camp Director</span><h4>Mike McCabe</h4><p>Head Cross Country / Track &amp; Field Coach, Union Catholic High School</p></div><div class=\"uc-camp-staff__support\"><span class=\"uc-staff-role\">Senior Counselors</span><h4>Brian Kopnicki</h4><p>Assistant Coach, Union Catholic</p><h4 style=\"margin-top:20px!important\">Brian Sagendorf</h4><p>Mt. St. Mary’s University</p></div></section><div class=\"uc-camp-sectionhead\"><h3>Camp Experience</h3><p>Learn, compete, and have fun</p></div><section class=\"uc-camp-gallery\"><figure><img alt=\"Union Catholic Track and Field camp\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2013/04/EF6C4857-161D-4B37-9039-4EFED0AC5365-e1494547544228.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"Young athletes at Union Catholic Track and Field camp\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/A14275CC-A162-4EE1-A6FB-572773D22336-e1494546107134.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"Union Catholic summer track camp athlete\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/82744483-B078-41A7-9B59-14370CD60FAF-e1494546128124.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"Track and field instruction at Union Catholic camp\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/97142DDE-DB21-482C-82FA-B21152A374B1-e1494546142728.jpg\"/></figure></section><section class=\"uc-camp-contact\"><div><h3>Questions about camp?</h3><p>Contact Camp Director Mike McCabe for information about the Union Catholic Track &amp; Field Camp.</p></div><div class=\"uc-camp-contact__actions\"><a href=\"mailto:mmccabe@unioncatholic.org\">Email Coach McCabe</a><a href=\"tel:+19083707666\">Call 908-370-7666</a></div></section></div></div>\n</article>\n</div>\n</section>\n"}